# CQ:         CQII.1
# Question:   What is the difference between a statistical co-occurrence and an
#             explicitly typed relationship between two artists in the KG?
# Modelling:  Probes for *both* shapes; the typed-relationship branch is empty
#             until ontology-level relations such as viewsari:hasPupil or
#             viewsari:Collaboration are introduced.

PREFIX viewsari: <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/>

ASK {
  { ?cooc a viewsari:0001025 . }
  UNION
  { ?rel  a viewsari:Collaboration . }
}
